{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/caches"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Caches\/documentation\/Caches"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"metadata":{"role":"collection","title":"Caches","externalID":"Caches","symbolKind":"module","modules":[{"name":"Caches"}],"roleHeading":"Framework"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Caches\/documentation\/Caches\/LRUCache"},{"type":"text","text":" holds at most a fixed number of entries. Storing one more when it is full evicts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the least recently used entry, where reading a value or storing it counts as a use."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import Caches","","var cache = LRUCache<String, Int>(capacity: 2)","cache[\"a\"] = 1","cache[\"b\"] = 2","_ = cache[\"a\"]                     \/\/ 1, and \"a\" is now the most recent","cache[\"c\"] = 3                     \/\/ evicts \"b\", the least recent","cache.map(\\.key)                   \/\/ [\"c\", \"a\"]"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The entries live in one flat array, linked by indices from the most recent to the least, beside"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a hash table from keys to positions, so every operation is O(1) on average. "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Caches\/documentation\/Caches\/LRUCache\/peek(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Caches\/documentation\/Caches\/LRUCache\/contains(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" read without promoting, "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Caches\/documentation\/Caches\/LRUCache\/insert(_:forKey:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" reports the"},